<title>FRANCE: Latest details of EU grain export/import balance.</title>
<headline>Latest details of EU grain export/import balance.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1997-01-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>Following are details of EU grain export/import commitments as of January 21 in the July-to-June 1996/97 campaign, supplied by member country officials.</p>
<p>On January 23, the EU additionally granted exports of 71,900 tonnes of soft wheat, 75,000 tonnes of barley, 5,000 tonnes of rye, and 34,500 tonnes of oats though its weekly grain tender system.</p>
<p>Figures ('000 tonnes) are based on officially communicated certificates and are subject to revision.</p>
<p>			 ---------1996/97-------  ------1995/96-----</p>
<p>			     1Jul96 to 21Jan 97     1Jul95 to 21Jan96</p>
<p>			 EXPORTS  PCT(1) IMPORTS  EXPORTS    IMPORTS</p>
<p>  Soft wheat(grain)  6,424     149     729    4,300	1,128</p>
<p>  Flour (2)	    3,868     128	10    3,017	   12</p>
<p>Food aid</p>
<p>    - grain		246	69	 0	358	    0</p>
<p>    - flour (2)	   98	90	 0	109	    0</p>
<p>Donations</p>
<p>    - grain		  0		   -	305	    -</p>
<p>    - flour (2)	   13		   0	 76	    0</p>
<p> TOTAL SOFT WHEAT   10,649     130     739    8,165	1,140</p>
<p>  Durum (grain)	   91		 322	 16	  739</p>
<p>  Semolina (3)	   288     900	 0	 32	    0</p>
<p>  Food aid		   1		   0	 53	    0</p>
<p> TOTAL DURUM WHEAT     380     376     322	101	  739</p>
<p> ALL WHEAT	    11,0129    133   1,061    8,266	1,879</p>
<p>  Barley (grain)     3,724     303	30    1,231	  123</p>
<p>  Malt (4)	     2,568     117	 0    2,187	    0</p>
<p>  Donations		  0		   -	  0	    -</p>
<p> TOTAL BARLEY	  6,292     184	30    3,418	  123</p>
<p>  Maize (grain)	   40    1000     281	  4	2,127</p>
<p>  Food aid		  11		   -	 11	    -</p>
<p> TOTAL MAIZE		51     340     281	 15	2,127</p>
<p>  Rye (grain)	    678	58	 3    1,170	   33</p>
<p>  Rye flour (5)	    0		   0	  0	    0</p>
<p>Donations</p>
<p>    - grain		  0		   -	  0	    -</p>
<p>    - flour (5)	    0		   -	  0	    -</p>
<p> TOTAL RYE		 678	58	 3     1,170	  33</p>
<p> OATS			288     702	 1	 41	    1</p>
<p>  Sorghum (grain)	  0		   4	  0	  832</p>
<p>  Food aid		   0		   -	  0	    -</p>
<p> TOTAL SORGHUM	     0		   4	  0	  832</p>
<p>OTHER GRAINS</p>
<p>Buckwheat, Millet,</p>
<p>   Triticale		 1		 139	  1	   81</p>
<p> TOTAL GRAIN	  18,339     142   1,519   12,911	5,076</p>
<p>Note -- (1) column shows this year's exports expressed as a percentage of last year's exports, not as a percentage change (2) wheat equivalent (3) durum equivalent (4) barley equivalent (5) rye equivalent.</p>
<p>-- Paris newsroom +331 4221 5432</p>
